big news morgans is a former member of  the roger pirates in other words a  member of the most powerful and  influential pirate crew in history  someone who fought side by side with the  likes of shanks rayleigh and roger  himself reaching the last island of the  grand line and just like shanks croakus  or rayleigh he has worked hard behind  the scenes to make rogers last welcome  true and has helped luffy to get where  he is today using his influence on the  world government and his monopoly on  information in the one piece worlds this  sounds of course absolutely preposterous  and i thought the exact same thing when  i first stumbled across this idea on my  subreddit wild anime theories however as  the reddit user legendary points out  correctly there is actually surprisingly  much evidence pointing in exactly that  direction and when you follow the  breadcrumbs that odel sensei left us it  only leaves us with one possible  conclusion big news morgan is very  likely a roger pirate to be more precise  he's one of these men right here i'll  tell you why in just a second also if  you haven't yet make sure to subscribe  it's actually free big news morgan is  not just anyone but one of the most  influential and powerful people in the  world and we really have no idea what he  actually looks like after all hola  sensei has confirmed that morgan's isn't  some type of intelligent animal like for  example a member of the mink's tribe but  a human that has eaten the bird bird  zone fruit model albatross in other  words similar to chopper morrigan is  constantly in his hybrid form so he  could be someone we've seen in the story  before without us ever realizing it  here's what we know so far about big  news morgan he's the president of the  world economy newspaper in other words  he's the one who prints the newspapers  that are being distributed across the  world by the infamous new school that's  the name of these birds that distribute  the news across the one piece worlds  while morgan's and his team look and  feel very quirky you shouldn't let  yourself be fooled here he is incredibly  powerful this world is fully controlled  by a global world government that not  only rewrites history to fit its own  purposes but also goes extremely hard  against anyone trying to share truths  and news that could harm its power i  mean just ask the scholars of o'hara  controlling information and keeping the  citizens of the world badly informed has  probably been the government's most  powerful tool to stay in power for the  past 800 years and yet here we have this  man that runs the world's biggest  newspaper that makes morgan one of the  most dangerous and influential people on  the planet i'm really curious why the  government has allowed him to build such  a monopoly in the first place my  personal guess would be that morgan used  to play along very nicely with the  government and kind of help them spread  their propaganda i mean we've already  seen that the government tried to bribe  him and that they had an undercover  agent at his office and so it really  feels like it was only quite recently  that morrigans has gone so openly  against the gorosei another reason  however is that morgans is one of the  emperors of the underworld where the  governments countries and pirates  altogether trade weapons information and  really anything else that's shady and  imaginable away from the public eye not  only does he have the power to shape  global opinions about anything but he  can also blackmail others by sharing  sensitive information literally for many  years he was part of the system that  helped the yonko and the government  alike in controlling the news and  cementing their power and even though  his influence is mostly through  information he is also physically quite  strong having no problem whatsoever  dealing with the cyphapul agent that  threatened him or standing side by side  with some of the strongest people in the  story heck he knew exactly that stussy  was an undercover agent as well and what  she was capable of and yet he was not in  the slightest intimidated by her  presence it was really only at the end  of whole cake island that morgan started  doing his own thing here he revealed his  interest in the supernova and started  cheering for luffy in particular to  become the next pirate king now you  could of course argue that all of these  things could simply be the  characteristics of a cunning and tough  journalist who just wants to get money  and i guess excitement out of it for  himself however this is where things get  a little bit fishy first of all what we  mentioned earlier it's really strange  that he never leaves his hybrid form  this is clearly to protect his true  identity in some way or form the only  question is who could morgans be that  would be so problematic for his job it  must be someone who would get him into  trouble either with the government or  cost him his credibility with his  readers also this journalist who has a  secret identity should be pretty  familiar to you because it's basically  the superman trope now i don't think  that morgans is the lurking legend or  anything like that but i do think that  this is oda sensei's take on that  superman trope and his fruit itself is  also quite suspicious too morgan is an  albatross devil fruit user the albatross  is notorious for its long-distance  flying abilities and yet morgan here  allegedly can't fly we also do know for  a fact that morgan was the one who  reported on luffy's exploit on whole  cake island and who declared him as the  next emperor before he made his way to  wano in fact we can assume that it was  his newspaper that has been distributing  news about the straw hats exploits  throughout the story and as far as i  remember the straw hats have always been  portrayed in quite a positive light  presented as this powerful crew of  upcoming pirates that bring turmoil to  wherever they go and while it's still  unclear whether or not morgan's has any  influence on the bounties themselves he  still seems to be the one to print and  distribute all bouncy posters i mean he  clearly was the one who put the photo of  gear 5 luffy on the new wanted poster  and has also included the d in his name  and so all of that strongly hints at big  news morgan having a secret agenda and a  secret identity that's actually pretty  crazy when you think about it so crazy  in fact that not only did i change my  outfit but it also got me hungry enough  for a snack and as luffy and co have  just learned during the celebrations in  wano there is nothing better but the  food from a traditional japanese  festival luckily the good people over at  baksu have us covered for exactly that  because this month's snack box theme is  matsuri  nights just seeing these lanterns makes  me wanna go to one so badly as you  probably already know each of these  monthly snack boxes contain a wonderful  assortment of traditional japanese  snacks candies and tea pairings from  local manufacturers here in japan no  matter where you live you can order the  same real japanese experience to your  house this here for example is covered  in chocolate and mixed with green tea  grown in kyoto but honestly all of this  month's box looks super delicious if you  want to get your hands on one of these  as well you can use the link in the  description below and use my personal  code o'hara for 15  of your very first order however why do  i say with such certainty that he might  be a roger pirate in disguise in  particular well you better put your  seatbelt on for this one let's begin  with the matter of roger finding the one  piece and becoming pirate king in the  first place i mean since it's the  premise for the entire story i think  none of us has ever really stopped and  questioned how roger got so famous in  the first place because when you think  about it it's kind of fishy too roger  was the first person in 800 years to  reach the last islands there he found  the one piece and named the island laugh  tale based on joyboy's story that he  read there however why would anyone  believe him who confirmed with certainty  that this actually happened and that  roger didn't just make it up in other  words someone had to actually tell the  press that this happened because roger  clearly wasn't the one who told the  world and if he did nobody would have  believed him we also saw that he was  reading the epithet pirate king in the  newspaper himself and found it amusing  so clearly it wasn't his idea and the  easiest explanation here is that the  news about roger were spread by someone  who was actually there in other words a  journalist who accompanied roger on his  trip either because roger was nice  enough to let him or because roger  himself just wanted to make a bit of a  name for himself and i do believe that  this person was morgan the man who  became famous for breaking the story and  naming roger pirates king this would  also explain morgan's crazy obsession  with luffy and the race for the next  pirate king perfectly as well as you  know roger was waiting for the return of  joyboy and in anticipation of his death  he did everything in his power to ease  the way for his return he fathered at  least one child with ace that he hoped  would become joy boy later he then  tasked his men with carrying on his will  and prepared joyboy's arrival he sent  out shanks to find the right person and  get his hands on the nikanika fruit  chang's was to give that person the  fruit and entrust him with roger's hat  he then stationed crocus at the entrance  to the grand line to scout for the  person with the straw hat tell them  about the final island and teach them  how to navigate the first half of the  grand line he then stationed his right  hand man rayleigh at the halfway point  on sabah odi rayleigh in the very same  matter would also identify joyboy by its  hat train him and then help him cross  into the new world the second part of  the grand line and one possibility is  that his third in command scapa gabon is  now waiting on roadstar island to teach  joyboy about love tale and the final  journey there but i guess that's a story  for uh not the video in itself because  as you've figured out by now morgan  would fit this pattern perfectly he has  helped to spread luffy's legend he's the  one who declared him an emperor and who  believes that he will be the next pirate  king now we've heard many people believe  in luffy finding the one piece and  becoming pirate king before but morgan  at least as i remember is the only one  that has never met luffy in person and  still believes it why well because he  also recognized  straw hats and so morgan has made sure  to favor luffy in public perception and  ease his way how so you may ask now well  remember how rayleigh shanks and ko keep  up with luffy's developments we've seen  shanks more than once read about luffy  in the news for whatever reason it seems  to be his trusted source of information  about luffy i personally would assume  that you would also expect chance to  keep an eye on luffy in some other way  but he seems suspiciously content with  just a regular newspaper well if morgan  was his former crewmate part of the same  mission to help joyboy then of course  shanks would trust that information heck  morgan most likely would put it there  for members of the roger crew to see in  the first place in this context i also  want you to think about the aftermath of  the war at marineford luffy returns to  marine hq to literally send a message to  the rest of the crew to train for two  years and meet back at sabah odi strong  enough to make it to the world blah blah  but that wasn't actually luffy's idea  yeah you guessed it it was rayleigh's  rayleigh proposed to luffy to get a  picture taken at marine fort with the  message on his arm visible to the  cameras and it was rayleigh who  accompanied him there yes it was a real  ballsy stunt of luffy to come back but  there was absolutely no guarantee that  it would make the news or that they  would use that exact picture of luffy  with the message clearly visible what if  the government wanted to cover this up  as well avoiding the humiliation of  having luffy back there and having him  escape a second time however if morgan  the one curating the news here was an  ally of rayleigh then of course he could  ensure that the straw hats receive  luffy's message in other words rayleigh  and morgan could have staged the entire  thing as a massive media stunt luffy  rings the bell lays down flowers and  then takes his hat off to pay respect to  those who have fallen while the marines  charge in there in the background like  idiots the reporters really have no  chance but portray luffy as the noble  mysterious rookie who has come with  jinbe and silva's rayleigh and one of  the reporters literally says this is big  news morgan's catchphrase before we ever  get to even meet him and once again we  see the marines reacting to this news  breaking saying that the article already  has spread around the world and is too  late to stop so once again just like on  whole cake islands and on wano news  about luffy gets out that the government  wants to keep quiet and morgan being a  roger pirate also would explain one of  the biggest plot holes in the entire  story why the hell is luffy's full name  always displayed on his wanted posters  we do know that the gorosei wants to  keep the d initial a secret including  for luffy as we well learned after wano  yet luffy has been wanted as monkey d  luffy on every single bouncy poster so  far i mean the government wanted to hide  that the initial so hard they even  bothered to rename goldie roger into  gold roger they also surely wanted to  hide luffy being related to garth so if  the government would have had it say i  bet that luffy would have been just  luffy on the bounty posters just how  shanks is just shanks but then if you  have someone in the news accidentally  publishing the d initial however who  operates on his own terms and who wants  the d-clan out in the open that would  explain a lot morgan really is the  missing piece linking rayleigh and  shanks and the other members of the  roger pirates that are now working to  make luffy the next pirate king and the  reason that hola sensei hides his  appearance is because we've now met all  of roger's crew through odin's flashback  and age-wise it also fits pretty  smoothly because he was in his early 20s  during roger's journey to love tales so  who out of rogers men here could morgans  possibly be i have four candidates for  you first is this guy here peter moo  that's just because he has a very  similar body shape to morgan's and is  also wearing a feathered hat then there  is momora who also wears a hat that is  strangely shaped like a bird set there  is moon isaac jr who has this  beak-shaped nose and who might be based  on sir isaac newton who discovered  gravity you know opposed to flight maybe  and finally there is spencer who i  really just threw in here because he  looks pretty much like a male version of  nami and i just wanted to kind of  mention that because it's kind of odd  another idea that i've seen thrown  around is that morgan might have been  the thing inside the giant egg here that  was on board of the roger pirates ship  however that is a whole different beast  i personally think and if you really  want to know what it is you can't miss  out on that video  right here
 

